<title>SRI LANKA: Central Finance 12-mth net up 39 pct.</title>
<headline>Central Finance 12-mth net up 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year to March</p>
<p>31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			  1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	4,903.06  vs     4,545.55</p>
<p>    Net profit	158.57  vs	 113.86</p>
<p>    Tax provision     5.76  vs	   5.02</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Central Finance consolidates accounts with Central Industries Ltd, Central Securities Ltd, E.B Creasy &amp; Co.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
